listed = sync_navigation(sidebar_id)!
[section, $md:
    # Closures

    A row editor knows what someone typed. The code that built the editor knows
    which row they edited. A closure brings those two pieces together. It can
    use a value from the surrounding code each time someone calls it.

    **Planned feature.** Moth has accepted constrained closures for implementation
    after the syntax migration. The current compiler can't run these examples.
    See @../progress (Compiler progress).
]

